1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:01,551
Here's a secret.

2
00:00:01,551 --> 00:00:03,878
ChatGPT never plans its answer.

3
00:00:03,878 --> 00:00:07,480
It writes one tiny piece at a time, by guessing!

4
00:00:07,480 --> 00:00:08,880
Let's play!

5
00:00:10,225 --> 00:00:10,773
Round 1!

6
00:00:10,773 --> 00:00:12,963
First, your message gets chopped

7
00:00:12,963 --> 00:00:15,590
into little pieces, called tokens.

8
00:00:18,225 --> 00:00:20,089
Round 2! Guess the next word.

9
00:00:20,089 --> 00:00:21,439
The cat sat on the...

10
00:00:21,439 --> 00:00:22,403
mat? rug? moon?

11
00:00:22,403 --> 00:00:23,803
Mat wins!

12
00:00:24,100 --> 00:00:25,078
How does it know?

13
00:00:25,078 --> 00:00:26,861
It read a giant library of text

14
00:00:26,861 --> 00:00:28,599
and learned the patterns.

15
00:00:30,225 --> 00:00:30,711
Round 3!

16
00:00:30,711 --> 00:00:32,532
Add the word, and guess again.

17
00:00:32,532 --> 00:00:33,807
And again. And again!

18
00:00:33,807 --> 00:00:35,207
Super fast.

19
00:00:36,100 --> 00:00:37,375
A pinch of randomness,

20
00:00:37,375 --> 00:00:39,587
so it doesn't sound like a robot.

21
00:00:42,725 --> 00:00:45,295
So... does it really understand you?

22
00:00:46,475 --> 00:00:48,684
It's the world's best next-word guesser.

23
00:00:48,684 --> 00:00:50,120
And that's enough to write

24
00:00:50,120 --> 00:00:52,132
poems, code, and your homework!

25
00:00:56,225 --> 00:00:58,971
Follow for more AI in 60 seconds!
